{
  "id": "s15-delete",
  "role": "維護者",
  "title": "刪除小節",
  "local": {
    "name": "lufor129",
    "watch": [
      "semiconductor"
    ]
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "issue": {
        "var": "issue_pm",
        "title": "機台保養（PM）多久做一次？",
        "labels": [
          "待回答",
          "kb:semiconductor"
        ],
        "body": "🤖 由 Agent 產生\n\n## 問題\n機台保養（PM）多久做一次？\n\n## 新人當時在讀哪一章\n檢測量測（猜的）\n\n## 誰問的\n小美"
      }
    },
    {
      "branch": {
        "name": "kb/semiconductor/pm-section",
        "edits": [
          {
            "file": "kb/semiconductor/handbook/2-manufacturing/09-metrology.md",
            "before": "<a name=\"wat\"></a>",
            "text": "<a name=\"pmx\"></a>\n## 機台保養 PM\n\n廠裡會事先排好保養：蝕刻、CVD 照 RF 運轉時數算，CMP 照研磨墊磨了幾片算，天數只是保底[^pmx-1]。\n\n[^pmx-1]: 老王（製程整合）口述，2026-10\n\n"
          },
          {
            "file": "kb/semiconductor/handbook/2-manufacturing/09-metrology.md",
            "append": "\n<details>\n<summary>機台保養（PM）多久做一次？</summary>\n看機台，多半照用量算，天數只是保底。\n相關：pmx、apc\n</details>\n"
          },
          {
            "file": "kb/semiconductor/terms.md",
            "append": "| 定期保養 | Preventive Maintenance (PM) | 照固定週期排好的保養 | pmx |\n"
          },
          {
            "file": "kb/semiconductor/deck/order.md",
            "replace": [
              "→ eyes@",
              "→ pmx, eyes@"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "commit": "半導體：檢測量測新增機台保養 PM",
        "pr": {
          "var": "pr_pm",
          "title": "半導體製程：檢測量測新增機台保養 PM（回答 #{issue_pm}）",
          "labels": [
            "kb:semiconductor",
            "來歷:訪談"
          ],
          "body": "🤖 由 Agent 產生\n\n## 改了什麼\n- 新增 `pmx` 機台保養 PM、一題常見問題、一個術語。\n\n## 來歷\n訪談\n\nCloses #{issue_pm}"
        },
        "run": [
          "python3 framework/tools/check.py --fp semiconductor eyes"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "merge": "pr_pm"
    }
  ],
  "sessions": [
    {
      "first": "檢測量測那章的 pmx 小節（機台保養）是用虛構人物「老王」的口述寫的，不是真的訪談。請把它刪掉，相關的常見問題和術語也一起處理。開變更提案，檢查過了就合併。",
      "persona": "lufor129，半導體知識庫的維護者，也是框架維護者。Agent 問要不要重新打開相關的 issue 時，說好。",
      "goal": "pmx 刪乾淨、提案合併，相關的 issue 也處理好。都做完就結束。",
      "max_turns": 4
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "text": "用了 kb-change",
      "type": "skill",
      "name": "kb-change"
    },
    {
      "text": "主線上沒有 pmx 小節了",
      "type": "file",
      "ref": "main",
      "path": "kb/semiconductor/handbook/2-manufacturing/09-metrology.md",
      "pattern": "<a name=\"pmx\">",
      "absent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "常見問題裡沒有指向 pmx 的引用",
      "type": "file",
      "ref": "main",
      "path": "kb/semiconductor/handbook/2-manufacturing/09-metrology.md",
      "pattern": "相關：[^\\n]*pmx",
      "absent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "頁序裡沒有指向 pmx 的對應",
      "type": "file",
      "ref": "main",
      "path": "kb/semiconductor/deck/order.md",
      "pattern": "pmx",
      "absent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "術語表裡沒有只給 pmx 用的術語",
      "type": "file",
      "ref": "main",
      "path": "kb/semiconductor/terms.md",
      "pattern": "\\| pmx \\|",
      "absent": true
    },
    {
      "text": "主線通過檢查",
      "type": "check_ok",
      "ref": "main"
    },
    {
      "text": "原本被這一節回答的 #{issue_pm} 重新打開",
      "type": "issue_state",
      "issue": "{issue_pm}",
      "state": "OPEN"
    }
  ],
  "judge": [
    "主動發現被刪的內容原本回答了一個 issue，提出重新打開"
  ]
}
